      "extra_snippets": [
        "Although Marx articulated a metabolic understanding of the relationship between society and nature, these insights remained largely programmatic and insufficiently specified at the institutional level. Plekhanov develops this ecological kernel into an organological framework that distinguishes conditions from causes and situates ecological constraints within mediated processes of social reproduction.",
